#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with &kivio;"
msgstr "Traballar con &kivio;"

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening a Document"
msgstr "Abrir un Documento"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open a previously saved document select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, a standard &kde; "
"file dialog box will appear."
msgstr ""
"Para abrir un documento guardado con anterioridade use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu><guimenuitem>Abrir...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, aparecerá o diálogo estándar de ficheiros de &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Recently used documents are listed under <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saving a Document"
msgstr "Guardar un Documento"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To save the current document select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> to give an existing file a different name."
msgstr ""
"Para guardar o documento actual escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Guargar</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu><guimenuitem>Guardar Como...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> para guardar cun nome diferente a un ficheiro que "
"xa exista."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to save the document in a format that can be opened by "
"earlier versions of &kivio;. Select the version you require from the "
"<guilabel>Filter:</guilabel> combo box in the save file dialog."
msgstr ""
"É posíbel guardar o documento nun formato que pode ser aberto por versións "
"anteriores de &kivio;. Escolla a versión que queira na lista "
"<guilabel>Filtro:</guilabel> no diálogo de guardar ficheiro."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Impresión"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The document can be printed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Print...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The standard &kde; "
"printing dialog appears. A preview of the printed output can be obtained by "
"selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Print Preview...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"O documento pode ser impreso escollendo <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Imprimir...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Aparecerá o "
"diálogo estándar de impresión de &kde;. Pode obter unha antevisión da saída "
"impresa mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Antevisión da Impresión...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing/Exporting Documents"
msgstr "Importar/Exportar Documentos"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Import...</guimenuitem> menu option on the <guimenu>File</"
"guimenu> menu currently loads a &kivio; or &XML; document into a new &kivio; "
"application."
msgstr ""
"A opción <guimenuitem>Importar</guimenuitem> do menú <guimenu>Ficheiro</"
"guimenu> na actualidade carga un documento &kivio; ou &XML; nunha nova "
"xanela de &kivio;."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Export...</guimenuitem> menu option on the <guimenu>File</"
"guimenu> menu currently perform the same functions as "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. These options let you save a document under a different name or "
"into an other format."
msgstr ""
"A opción <guimenuitem>Exportar...</guimenuitem> no menú <guimenu>Ficheiro</"
"guimenu> realiza as mesmas funcións que <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Guardar Como...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Estas "
"opcións permítenlle guardar un documento cun nome diferente ou noutro "
"formato."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Documents with Multiple Pages"
msgstr "Documentos con Varias Páxinas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "A &kivio; document can contain several pages of diagrams."
msgstr "Os documentos de &kivio; poden conter varias páxinas de diagramas."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Pages"
msgstr "Engadir Páxinas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To <action>add additional pages</action> to a document select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Page</guimenu><guimenuitem>Insert Page</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> or click with the &RMB; on the page tab and select "
"<guimenuitem>Insert Page</guimenuitem> from the context menu. The selector "
"beneath the document view shows tabs for all the pages in the document that "
"have not been hidden."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing Pages"
msgstr "Eliminar Páxinas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unwanted pages can be removed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Page</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove Page</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or click with "
"the &RMB; on the page tab and select <guimenuitem>Remove Page</guimenuitem> "
"from the context menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renaming Pages"
msgstr "Mudar o Nome dunha Páxina"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The names given to each page can be adjusted by double-clicking on the page "
"name on the page selector or by clicking with the &RMB; on the page tab and "
"select <guimenuitem>Rename Page...</guimenuitem> from the context menu. A "
"dialog box will appear allowing the name to be edited."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Pages"
msgstr "Traballar con Páxinas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The order of the pages can be adjusted by dragging the tabs on the page "
"selector bar."
msgstr ""
"Pode axustar a orde das páxinas arrastando as pestanas na barra do selector."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The arrow buttons on the page selector bar are for scrolling through the "
"page tabs, they do not cycle through the pages themselves."
msgstr ""
"Os botóns en frecha na barra do selector de páxina permiten desprazarse "
"polos separadores das páxinas, non circulan as páxinas en si."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have a lot of pages in a document and you do not want to see them all "
"on the page selector you can hide pages by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Page</guimenu><guimenuitem>Hide Page</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. This will remove the currently selected page from the page "
"selector bar."
msgstr ""
"Se ten moitas páxinas nun documento e non quer velas todas no selector de "
"páxinas pode acochar as que desexe mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Páxina</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Acochar Páxina</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Isto ha "
"eliminar a páxina escollida do selector de páxinas."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To reveal a hidden page select <menuchoice><guimenu>Page</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Page...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and choose the "
"page you want to see from the list box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exporting a Page"
msgstr "Exportar unha Páxina"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Individual pages can be exported as bitmap graphics files. To export the "
"current page select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Export...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. A standard &kde; file dialog box appears. The export format is "
"determined by the name extension you give the file, it must end with one of "
"the extensions listed below."
msgstr ""
"Pode exportar páxinas soltas nun ficheiro gráfico. Para exportar a páxina "
"escollida use <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu><guimenuitem>Exportar..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou <menuchoice><guimenu>Ficheiro</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Guardar Como...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Mostrarase o "
"diálogo de ficheiro de &kde;. Pode escoller o formato no que exportar "
"mediante o nome da extensión que lle dé ao ficheiro, debe ser unha das que "
"se listan embaixo."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "The following formats are supported:"
msgstr "Están soportados os seguintes formatos:"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "PNG Image (.png)"
msgstr "Imaxe PNG (.png)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "JPEG Image (.jpg)"
msgstr "Imaxe JPEG (.jpg)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "BMP Image (.bmp)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Encapsulated Postscript Image (.eps)"
msgstr "Imaxe Postscript Embebida (.eps)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Portable Bitmap (.pbm)"
msgstr "Mapa de bits portábel (.pbm)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "PCX Image (.pcx)"
msgstr "Imaxe PCX (.pcx)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Portable Pixmap Image (.ppm)"
msgstr "Mapa de Píxeis Portábel (.ppm)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "SGI Image (RGB) (.rgb)"
msgstr "Imaxe SGI (RGB) (.rgb)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "X PixMap Image (.xpm)"
msgstr "Imaxe PixMap das X (.xpm)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "JPEG 2000 Image (.jp2)"
msgstr "Imaxe JPEG 2000 (.jp2)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Krita Document (.kra)"
msgstr "Documento de Krita (.kra)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adobe Illustrator Document (.ai)"
msgstr "Documento de Adobe Illustrator (.ai)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "TIFF Image (.tiff)"
msgstr "Imaxe TIFF (.tiff)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "ILM EXR Image (.exr)"
msgstr "Imaxe ILM EXR (.exr)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Karbon14 Document (.karbon)"
msgstr "Documento Karbon14 (.karbon)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "GIMP Native Image Format (.xcf)"
msgstr "Imaxe do GIMP (.xcf)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scalable Vector Graphics (.svg)"
msgstr "Gráfico Vectoriais Escalábeis (.svg)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Windows; MetaFile (.wmf)"
msgstr "Metaficheiro de &Windows; (.wmf)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have to confirm the export, because this may result in some loss of "
"formatting. Click the button <guibutton>Save</guibutton> and the "
"<guilabel>Export to Image</guilabel> dialog is displayed. In this dialog you "
"can set some export options: <guilabel>Page:</guilabel> range, the "
"<guilabel>Area to export:</guilabel>, the <guilabel>Bitmap DPI:</guilabel> "
"and the <guilabel>Margin (Pixels):</guilabel> of the page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Grid"
msgstr "A Grella"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kivio; displays a regularly spaced grid over the document to aid stencil "
"positioning. The visibility of the grid can be toggled by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Grid</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"&kivio; mostra unha grella espaciada regularmente sobre o documento para "
"axudar no posicionamento das figuras. Pode escoller se ver a grella mediante "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guimenuitem>Mostrar Grella</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Objects edges are snapped to the nearest point on the grid regardless of "
"whether it is visible. To toggle this behavior select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snap Grid</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Os contornos dos obxectos serán axustados para o ponto mais próximo na "
"grella con independencia da súa visibilidade. Para comutar este "
"comportamento escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Axustar á Grella</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To customize the grid select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kivio;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and "
"click on the <guiicon>Grid</guiicon> on the icon list."
msgstr ""
"Para personalizar a grella use <menuchoice><guimenu>Configuración</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configurar &kivio;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> e prema no "
"ícone <guiicon>Grella</guiicon> na lista de ícones."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog box will let you adjust the color the grid is drawn in, the "
"horizontal and vertical spacing and the snap distance."
msgstr ""
"Este diálogo halle permitir axustar a cor na que se debuxa a grella, o "
"espaciado horizontal e vertical e a distancia para axuste."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tip: It is possible to have a non-square grid by specifying different "
"horizontal and vertical spacings."
msgstr ""
"Nota: É posíbel ter grellas non cadradas indicando espazos horizontais e "
"verticais distintos."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Freestanding Text"
msgstr "Textos Libres"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The text tool can be used to add text to a document that is not associated "
"with any object. This is useful for noting general information about a "
"drawing."
msgstr ""
"A ferramenta de texto pode usarse para engadir texto non asociado cunha "
"figura. Isto é útil para anotar información xeral acerca dun obxecto."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add freestanding text make sure no object is selected by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Deselect </guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, then activate the text tool by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Text Tool</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. The mouse pointer will change to indicate the text tool is "
"activated."
msgstr ""
"Para engadir texto libre verifique que non hai nengún obxecto escollido "
"mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Editar</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Deseleccionar</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, logo active a ferramenta de texto mediante "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Ferramentas</guimenu><guimenuitem>Texto</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. O ponteiro do rato mudará para indicar que esta ferramenta está "
"activada."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Drag a box to contain the text. A dialog box will appear prompting for the "
"text, enter some text and click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. The formatting of "
"the text can be adjusted by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Text...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or by using the "
"toolbars."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Page Layout"
msgstr "Disposición da Páxina"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The page size, margins and orientation, portrait or landscape, can be "
"adjusted using the <guilabel>Page Size &amp; Margins</guilabel> dialog box. "
"This is accessible by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Page Layout...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Pode axustar o tamaño, as marxes e a orientación -retrato ou apaisado- da "
"páxina usando o diálogo <guilabel>Tamaño da Páxina e Marxes</guilabel>. "
"Chégase a el mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Disposición da Páxina...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Guides"
msgstr "Usar Guías"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Guides are lines used to help you position stencils. Not only can you use "
"guides as a visual reference when aligning items but, optionally, &kivio; "
"will snap stencils to guides. This means that as soon as the edge of a "
"stencil is within a certain distance to a guide it will immediately move to "
"the guide's position."
msgstr ""
"As guías son liñar que se usan para axudar a colocar as figuras. Non só pode "
"usalas como referencia visual ao aliñar obxectos, ademais &kivio; axustará "
"as figuras ás guías. Isto significa que en canto o limiar dunha figura se "
"acerque a unha certa distancia dunha guía, movera-a imediatamente á posición "
"da guía."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Guides"
msgstr "Engadir Guías"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a guide move the mouse pointer over either the horizontal or vertical "
"ruler, depending on the type of guide you require. Hold down the &LMB; and "
"drag the mouse over the document and release the mouse button where you want "
"to position the guide. As you drag the mouse the guide will move "
"accordingly. Or use <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add "
"Guide Line...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to open a dialog to select the "
"<guilabel>Orientation</guilabel> and the <guilabel>Position</guilabel> of "
"the guide."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Repositioning Guides"
msgstr "Desprazar as Guías"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once a guide is in place you can reposition it by moving the mouse over it, "
"holding down the &LMB; and dragging. Release the mouse button when the guide "
"is in its new position."
msgstr ""
"Poderá mudar a posición dunha liña de guía se lle pon o rato por acima, "
"mantén premido o &LMB; e a arrasta. Solte o botón do rato cando a guía "
"estexa na súa nova localización."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Visibility and Snapping"
msgstr "Visibilidade e Axuste"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To hide guides select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Guide "
"Lines</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, this toggles the visibility."
msgstr ""
"Para acochar as liñas-guía use <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Liñas de Guía</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, isto comuta a "
"visibilidade."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default stencil edges are snapped to the nearest guide, to toggle this "
"behavior select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Snap Grid</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Por omisión os contornos das figuras son axustadas á guía mais próxima, para "
"comutar este comportamento use <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Axustar á Grella</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "Capas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kivio; allows complex diagrams to be split into multiple layers. The "
"visibility of layers can be turned on and off. This functionality is useful "
"if you have a basic diagram, for example a floorplan, and need to create "
"several versions of it for different audiences. The information for each "
"audience can be placed in a different layer. Each page of the document has "
"its own set of layers."
msgstr ""
"&kivio; permite dividir diagramas complexos en múltiplas capas. A "
"visibilidade das capas pode ser comutada. Esta funcionalidade é útil se ten "
"un diagrama base, por exemplo un diagrama de fluxo básico, e precisa "
"elaborar varias versións para distintas alternativas. A información de cada "
"alternativa pode ser situada nunha capa diferente. Cada páxina do documento "
"ten o seu proprio conxunto de capas."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Layer Palette"
msgstr "A Paleta de Capas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To adjust the current page's layers select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Palettes</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Show Layers </"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The layer palette allows layers to be created, "
"deleted and renamed. It can also be used to adjust layer visibility, drawing "
"order and select the current layer."
msgstr ""
"Para traballar coas capas da páxina actual escolla "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Paletas</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Mostrar as Fiestras de Paletas</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A "
"paleta das capas permítelle criar, borrar e mudar o nome das capas. Tamén "
"pode ser usado para axustar a visibilidade, a orde na que se debuxan e para "
"escoller a capa de traballo."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kivio; has the concept of the currently active layer which is the one "
"affected by any editing actions. By default a page contains only one layer "
"which is the active layer."
msgstr ""
"&kivio; ten o conceito de capa activa que é aquela que é afectada polas "
"accións de edición. Por omisión unha páxina contén só unha capa que é a "
"activa."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Layers"
msgstr "Engadir Capas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Layers</guilabel> palette you can add new layers by "
"clicking the <guibutton>New Layer</guibutton> button, the first from the "
"left. Layers can be deleted by clicking the second button, <guibutton>Remove "
"Layer</guibutton>. &kivio; numbers the layers consecutively, to rename a "
"layer select it in the list and click <guibutton>Rename Layer</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Layer Settings"
msgstr "Configuración das Capas"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Layers are drawn in the order they are listed. The drawing occurs from the "
"top down so objects in the layer at the bottom of the list are drawn on top "
"of objects in all the other layers. The order of the list can be changed by "
"selecting a layer and using the <guibutton>Move Layer Up</guibutton> and "
"<guibutton>Move Layer Down</guibutton> buttons to change its position."
msgstr ""
"As Capas son debuxadas na orde na que se listan. Debúxase de riba para baixo "
"polo que os obxectos na capa do fondo da lista son debuxados sobre os das "
"outras capas. A orde na lista pode alterarse escollendo unha capa e usando "
"os botóns <guibutton>Elevar a Capa</guibutton> e <guibutton>Baixar a Capa</"
"guibutton> para mudar a súa posición."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each layer is listed with four small icons next to its name. From left to "
"right they represent:"
msgstr ""
"Cada capa na lista ten catro pequenos ícones xunto ao seu nome. Da esquerda "
"para a direita representan:"

#. Tag: term
#: working.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Visibility (shown as a small eye)"
msgstr "Visibilidade (mostrada como un pequeno ollo)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clicking on the icon will toggle the layer's visibility."
msgstr "Se preme no ícone comutará a visibilidade da capa."

#. Tag: term
#: working.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printable (shown as a small printer)"
msgstr "Imprimíbel (mostrada como unha pequena impresora)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Toggles if the layer should be printed with the document or not. You might "
"use a non-printing layer to keep notes to yourself, or as a scrapbook to "
"hold images you're not ready to use yet."
msgstr ""
"Indica se a capa será impresa xunto do documento ou non. Pode usar unha capa "
"non imprimíbel para manter notas para si, ou como un album de retallos para "
"conter cousas que ainda non estexan listas para seren usadas."

#. Tag: term
#: working.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editable (shown as a small pencil)"
msgstr "Editábel (mostrado como un pequeno lapis)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Toggles if you can edit a layer or not. You might want to mark some layers "
"non-editable while you work on others, to prevent inadvertant changes."
msgstr ""
"Indica se pode editar unha capa. Pode querer marcar algunhas capas como non "
"editábeis mentres traballa noutras, para evitar alteracións involuntarias."

#. Tag: term
#: working.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connectable (shown as a small connector)"
msgstr "Conectábel (mostrada como unha pequena conexón)"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can permit connecting of items that lie on different layers with this "
"icon."
msgstr "Pode permitir a conexón de figuras que estexan en capas distintas."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Arranging Stencils"
msgstr "Dispondo as Figuras"

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Align Tool"
msgstr "A Ferramenta de Aliñamento"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:199
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Align</guilabel> tool rearranges a group of stencils so "
#| "that they are aligned on one edge or on an invisible centerline. To use "
#| "the tool select several stencils, then select "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Format</guimenu><guimenuitem>Align &amp; "
#| "Distribute...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. If the stencils are arranged in "
#| "a horizontal row you the choice of aligning along the top or bottom edges "
#| "or the centerline. For stencils that are arranged in a vertical row the "
#| "choice is left or right edge or the centerline."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Align</guilabel> tool rearranges a group of stencils so that "
"they are aligned on one edge or on an invisible centerline. To use the tool "
"select several stencils, then select <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Align &amp; Distribute...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"If the stencils are arranged in a horizontal row you have the choice of "
"aligning along the top or bottom edges or the centerline. For stencils that "
"are arranged in a vertical row the choice is left or right edge or the "
"centerline."
msgstr ""
"A ferramenta <guilabel>Aliñar</guilabel> redistribui un grupo de figuras de "
"tal maneira que estexan aliñadas por un dos lados ou por unha liña central "
"invisíbel. Para usar esta ferramenta escolla varias figuras, logo use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Aliñar e Distribuir...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Se as figuras están dispostas nunha fila "
"horizontal terá a opción de aliñalas seguindo a parte superior ou inferior "
"ou á liña central. Se as figuras están dispostas nunha coluna terá as "
"opcións de aliñar á esquerda, direita ou á liña central."

#. Tag: title
#: working.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Distribute Tool"
msgstr "A Ferramenta Distribuir"

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Distribute</guilabel> tool arranges a group of stencils so "
"that there is an even amount of spacing between each stencil."
msgstr ""
"A ferramenta <guilabel>Distribuir</guilabel> dispón un grupo de figuras de "
"tal xeito que haxa unha cantidade igual de espazo entre cada figura."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First select the stencils you want to rearrange, then select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Format</guimenu><guimenuitem>Align &amp; Distribute...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> and click on the <guilabel>Distribute</guilabel> "
"tab in the tabbed window that appears."
msgstr ""
"Comece por escoller as figuras que queira redistribuir, logo escolla "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</guimenu><guimenuitem>Aliñar e Distribuir...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>e vaia para a páxina <guilabel>Distribuir</"
"guilabel> na xanela que aparece."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose whether the items should be spaced so that there is equal "
"spacing between two edges, for example, the distance between the lefthand "
"edge of each stencil should be the same. Or, whether the gap between each "
"item should be identical. Choose the <guilabel>Spacing</guilabel> option if "
"you desire this."
msgstr ""
"Pode escoller separar as figuras para que haxa a mesma distancia entes dous "
"límites, por exemplo, a distancia entre o lado esquerdo de cada figura debe "
"ser a mesma, ou se o oco entre cada dúas figuras debe ser o mesmo. Escolla "
"<guilabel>Espaciado</guilabel> se desexa isto."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second choice is whether the spacing should use the entire extent of the "
"page or just the extent of the selection. If the latter is chosen the "
"stencils will not occupy any more space than they did originally."
msgstr ""
"A segunda opción é se a separación debe usar toda a largura da páxina ou "
"limitarse á selección. Se escolle esta última as figuras non ocuparán mais "
"espazo do que orixinalmente."

#. Tag: para
#: working.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The option to use the extent of the page takes the page margins into "
"consideration."
msgstr ""
"A opción para usar todas a extensión da páxina toma en conta as marxes."
